 41	
 42	`RankingList` accepts formatted `RankingRow[]` and an accessible list `label`. Features supply stable keys, destinations, amounts, coverage, signs and bar widths. The list animates row and bar entry and disables animation for reduced motion. Party identities can omit destinations.
